{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんどーもーヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カフェで柚子茶を飲みながら\nblog書き書きしてる(((っ･ω･)っ/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味です♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/06/28/0843470/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな〜っ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のblogでの告白ちゃんと\n受け取ってくれた？(σ･ω･)σつんつん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(受け取ったよ〜♪)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おおっ♡ありがとっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ今度はみなさんからの\n告白聞きたいな〜(人-ω-)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい、ちょっと\n浮かれたところで(-ω-；)\nみなさんっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BLT×乃木坂46のコラボTシャツの\nデザインもう見ましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏は今回が初めての\nデザインTシャツだったんだけど\n絵を書けと言われると必ず\nうさちゃんを書いちゃう人なので\nTシャツもうさちゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うさちゃんたちが持ってる\nニンジンに大事なことが\n書いてあるからしっかり\nチェックしてみて下さ〜い♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていってもこのTシャツもまた\n浮かれたこと書いてます(´-ω-`*)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか今日は終始浮かれた\nblogになりそうです(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/06/28/0843470/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近新曲の歌披露の\n番組が盛りだくさんで\n楽しい〜ヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ♪♪"},{"type"